'''Vlad de Sable''' (ドバット ''Dobatto'') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Vlad de Sable
|image = E 199.png
|appearance = [[HALLOWEEN EVENT#All Hallows Road|All Hallows Road]]<br>[[Elite Corps (Insane)]]<br>[[Heavenly Tower]]<br>[[Infernal Tower]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
This variant of [[Pigeon de Sable]] has less health and attack power, but makes up for it with Area Attack. Thankfully, it loses the ability to produce waves, making this enemy a nuisance at best. Despite its appearance, it is not a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemy.

==Strategy==
Any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]] with the [[:Category:Cats with Massive Damage ability|massive damage]] ability will make mincemeat of this peon. Failing that, a stack of [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cats]] with proper meatshielding will always do the job, as this enemy has short range.

